# Cline Rules - Seprec Bolivia / Bolivia Empresas

## Project Overview
This is an Android application ("Bolivia Empresas" / "Seprec Bolivia") that allows users to search for companies registered in SEPREC Bolivia, view company details, track formalities (trámites), and locate SEPREC offices on a map.

## Tech Stack
- **Language**: Kotlin 2.2.10
- **UI**: Jetpack Compose (Material 3) with window size class support (phone & tablet)
- **Architecture**: MVVM with Clean Architecture
- **DI**: Dagger Hilt 2.53.1 (KAPT, not KSP — avoids Hilt+KSP classloader conflict)
- **Networking**: Retrofit 2 + OkHttp 4 + Gson
- **Database**: Room 2.7.1 (KSP)
- **Navigation**: Navigation Compose (4 tabs: search, tramite, map, me)
- **Maps**: Google Maps Compose 8.3.0 + Play Services Location + Maps
- **Background**: WorkManager
- **HTTP Inspector**: Chucker 4.3.1 (debug only)
- **Build**: Gradle 9.3.1 KTS, AGP 9.1.0, KSP 2.2.10-2.0.2
- **JDK**: 21 locally (Android Studio bundled), 17 for compile target
- **CI/CD**: GitHub Actions (build on push/PR, release on release/* branches)

## Versioning
- `versionName` and `versionCode` are manually updated in `app/build.gradle.kts`
- Release branches use pattern: `release/YYYY.MM.DD`
- Release name on GitHub: `release-YYYY.MM.DD`

## Signing
- Keystore: `bolivia_empresas.jks` (not committed to git — stored as GitHub Secret `KEYSTORE_BASE64`)
- Credentials read from env vars: `KEYSTORE_PASSWORD`, `KEY_ALIAS`, `KEY_PASSWORD`
- Fallback: debug keystore when env vars unavailable
- Release workflow decodes keystore on the fly in CI

## Project Structure
```
seprec_empresas/
├── app/                          # Main application module
│   ├── build.gradle.kts           # compileSdk 36, JVM 17, signing config
│   ├── src/main/java/com/locototeam/seprecbolivia/
│   │   ├── SeprecBoliviaApplication.kt     # @HiltAndroidApp
│   │   ├── Util.kt                          # Extension functions (date, network)
│   │   ├── ui/theme/                        # Material 3 theme (Color, Type, Theme)
│   │   ├── ui/view/
│   │   │   ├── MainActivity.kt              # Single activity, NavHost, bottom nav
│   │   │   ├── bottomNav/                   # BottomNavItem, BottomNavigationBar
│   │   │   ├── screen/homeList/             # HomeListScreen + HomeListViewModel
│   │   │   ├── screen/homeListDetail/       # HomeListDetail + ViewModel
│   │   │   ├── screen/Tramite/              # TramiteScreen + TramiteViewModel
│   │   │   ├── screen/map/                  # SeprecMapScreen (Google Maps)
│   │   │   ├── screen/Contact/              # InfoScreen
│   │   │   └── components/                  # Reusable composables
│   │   ├── framework/broadcaster/           # ConnectivityBroadcast
│   │   └── worker/                          # ConnectivityWorker
│   └── src/main/res/                        # Resources (values, values-es)
├── core/                          # Core library module
│   ├── build.gradle.kts           # compileSdk 36, JVM 17, Room KSP, Hilt KAPT
│   └── src/main/java/com/locototeam/core/
│       ├── model/                 # Company, CompanyDetail, TramiteDetail
│       ├── room/                  # SeprecDatabase, entities, DAOs (abstract class : UtilDao<T>)
│       ├── retrofit/              # CompanyService (Retrofit), NetworkResult
│       ├── repository/            # CompanyRepository, ICompanyService, DataSource
│       └── modules/               # NetworkModule, DatabaseModule (Hilt)
├── .github/workflows/
│   ├── build.yml                  # CI: assembleDebug + tests on push/PR
│   └── release.yml                # CD: assembleRelease + GitHub Release on release/*
└── gradle/
    └── libs.versions.toml         # Version catalog
```

## Modules
- **app** (`com.locototeam.seprecbolivia`): Application module, depends on `:core`
- **core** (`com.locototeam.core`): Library module with data layer (network, database, models, repository)

## API
- Base URL: `https://servicios.seprec.gob.bo/`
- Endpoints:
  - `GET api/empresas/buscarEmpresas?filtro=&limite=30&pagina=1` → Company
  - `GET api/empresas/informacionDirectorioEmpresa/{companyId}/establecimiento/{companyId}` → CompanyDetail
  - `GET api/tramites/buscarTramite?codigo=` → TramiteDetail

## Key Conventions
1. **Dependency Injection**: Use `@HiltViewModel` + `hiltViewModel()`. Hilt uses KAPT (not KSP).
2. **State Management**: `MutableStateFlow` + `asStateFlow()` in ViewModels. `collectAsState()` in composables.
3. **Network Results**: `NetworkResult` sealed class (NetworkSuccess, NetworkEmptyResult, NetworkFailure).
4. **Repository Pattern**: `CompanyRepository` delegates to `ICompanyService` via `by` keyword.
5. **Navigation**: Routes as constants in `MainActivity` companion. `navArgument` for params.
6. **Previews**: `@PreviewLightDark` with mock data via `.sample()` and `.empty()`.
7. **Localization**: `values/strings.xml` (English) + `values-es/strings.xml` (Spanish).
8. **Tablet Support**: `calculateWindowSizeClass()`, NavigationRail on tablet, NavigationBar on phone.
9. **Threading**: `viewModelScope.launch(Dispatchers.IO)` for network, `withContext(Dispatchers.Main)` for state.
10. **DAOs**: `abstract class XxxDao : UtilDao<Entity>` pattern. UtilDao has single-entity CRUD only.
11. **JVM Target**: Both modules target JVM 17 via `kotlin { compilerOptions { jvmTarget.set(JvmTarget.JVM_17) } }`.
12. **Java Version**: Both modules use `JavaVersion.VERSION_17`.

## When Changing Code
- DO NOT remove or alter Hilt annotations without understanding the dependency graph
- DO NOT change API endpoint paths without confirming with the SEPREC API
- DO NOT modify model data classes without updating ALL consumers
- Always use string resources with both English and Spanish variants
- Keep `core` module independent (no references to `app` module)
- Follow the existing pattern: ViewModel → Repository → DataSource → Service
- Use `sealed class` for event/state types within ViewModels
- Signing config uses `canSign` boolean — real keystore or debug fallback
